  "description": "The Voopoo Drag S2 pod vape kit is an exceptional choice for vapers of all experience levels, and one that combines ease of use with innovative vaping technology. Powered by an integrated 2500mAh battery , it offers extended usage between charges, making it ideal for all-day vaping. The kit's power output ranges from 5-60W , accommodating various vaping styles including MTL (Mouth-to-Lung) , RDTL (Restricted Direct-to-Lung), and DTL (Direct-to-Lung) . Equipped with Voopoo’s advanced Gene.TT 2.0 chipset , the Drag S2 offers three distinct vaping modes: Smart, Eco, and RBA . Smart Mode automatically detects the coil and sets the optimal power level, ensuring an effortless and efficient vaping experience. Eco Mode extends battery life, perfect for long days out, while RBA Mode gives you complete control over power output for a customized vape. Your kit includes the Voopoo PnP X DTL pod, featuring a convenient 2ml e-liquid capacity and a user-friendly side-filling system. Despite its DTL (Direct-to-Lung) designation, this pod is versatile enough to accommodate all PnP X coils, allowing for MTL, RDTL, and DTL vaping experiences. The kit includes a 0.3 Ohm coil, ideal for 32-40W with High VG E-Liquid, and a 0.2 Ohm coil, best between 40-60W with 70% VG vape juice . The Drag S2 stands out with its lightweight yet durable and ergonomic design, making it both comfortable to hold and convenient to carry. Whether you're new to vaping or an experienced enthusiast, the Voopoo Drag S2 Pod Kit offers a tailored experience with every flavour-rich puff. Complete your setup by choosing a vape juice uk that naturally suits this kit. We recommend using High VG E-Liquids with this kit. Please Note: To improve the performance and longevity of your new Coils, always prime them with your chosen e-liquid before inserting into your device 'Priming’ simply means wetting the exposed cotton or similar wicking material with e-liquid before use. This helps prevent dry hits and burning the coil should it fail to soak up e-liquid properly before firing the vape device. Once you've primed your pod, attached it to your device, allow to stand for 5-10 minutes before vaping.",
